        "title": "It is observed that in many countries not enough students are choosing to study science as a subject.  What are the causes? And what will be the effects on society?",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SGlldkAruoYzsHxmQfJl6wOjgzd\"><em><strong>It is observed that in many countries not enough students are choosing to study science as a subject. </strong></em></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CXQSdm7mJo8TBrx9YWlloZfAgJ6\"><em><strong>What are the causes? And what will be the effects on society?</strong></em></div>\n</div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NTzNd8mj9oUwbFx0MFilTG8bg97\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 2 - Lack of Science Students</em></p>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NTzNd8mj9oUwbFx0MFilTG8bg97\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1. Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li>Đề b&agrave;i Lack of Science Students&nbsp;n&ecirc;u l&ecirc;n một vấn đề l&agrave; số lượng học sinh chọn học khoa học (<strong>science</strong>) đang giảm ở nhiều quốc gia. Đề y&ecirc;u cầu ch&uacute;ng ta ph&acirc;n t&iacute;ch nguy&ecirc;n nh&acirc;n (<strong>causes</strong>) v&agrave; hậu quả (<strong>effects</strong>) của hiện tượng n&agrave;y đối với x&atilde; hội.</li>\n<li>Đ&acirc;y l&agrave; một chủ đề li&ecirc;n quan đến gi&aacute;o dục v&agrave; c&oacute; t&aacute;c động lớn đến sự ph&aacute;t triển của x&atilde; hội. Việc thiếu hụt nguồn nh&acirc;n lực trong lĩnh vực khoa học c&oacute; thể ảnh hưởng đến khả năng đổi mới (<strong style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol';\">innovate</strong><span style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol';\">) v&agrave; cạnh tranh (</span><strong style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol';\">competitiveness</strong><span style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol';\">) của một quốc gia tr&ecirc;n trường quốc tế.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CaaPdALkUoj39UxqBaClSdzHg7g\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2. Gợi &yacute; lập luận &amp; ph&acirc;n BODY&nbsp;</strong></span></h3>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li>B&agrave;i Lack of Science Students&nbsp;y&ecirc;u cầu ph&acirc;n t&iacute;ch nguy&ecirc;n nh&acirc;n v&agrave; hậu quả, n&ecirc;n ch&uacute;ng ta sẽ chia th&agrave;nh 2 BODY paragraph như sau:\n<ul>\n<li>BODY 1: Ph&acirc;n t&iacute;ch c&aacute;c nguy&ecirc;n nh&acirc;n ch&iacute;nh dẫn đến việc &iacute;t học sinh chọn học khoa học</li>\n<li>BODY 2: Ph&acirc;n t&iacute;ch c&aacute;c hậu quả đối với x&atilde; hội</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-O6Q8dKUwJolsRLxRHMKlYAGzgPb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3. Gợi &yacute; viết BODY 1</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ARYZdTorMo8GHUxXiaxlbgKog9K\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-B3WzdXi90obr9exqY49ldT5Wg2b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T3vid37FgouPrLxntpAllbSOgpd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ABpydqwzqoBt8mxtA2clX4h8gmh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FRtld534aoXQ8Cxcdevl45SsgZc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OtESdRTjnoSJwzxYBWkl2MvDgXb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UaoQdMKTxottsFx5xHZl5y6dgTe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ShyKdSzwIoav15xhSR1lkgYvgiN\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E00JdiJtsoaS4axMnNQltbz6gJe\">M&igrave;nh sẽ ph&acirc;n t&iacute;ch 2 nguy&ecirc;n nh&acirc;n ch&iacute;nh của việc học sinh ng&agrave;y c&agrave;ng &iacute;t chọn c&aacute;c ng&agrave;nh khoa học tự nhi&ecirc;n.&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E00JdiJtsoaS4axMnNQltbz6gJe\">Cấu tr&uacute;c đơn giản l&agrave;: Topic Sentence ➜ Supporting Idea 1 ➜ Supporting idea 2</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<strong><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\">Topic sentence:</span></strong>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J2Mgd651jokGr5xFFcTlMHOagYg\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YIkYdyyfZoikZgxMfM9ly4SYghh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Mk2zdFhmloeQGbxZgDwlEsvwgnh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-JesqdVbvXoysYjxqtf7lyoDSg7c\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-S0GAd5xJ8oGcMrxuRAElpmNagXe\">Xu hướng n&agrave;y bắt nguồn từ nhiều yếu tố, trong đ&oacute; c&oacute; việc mất hứng th&uacute; với m&ocirc;n học (<strong>the loss of interest</strong>) v&agrave; cơ hội nghề nghiệp hạn chế <strong>(limited career</strong> <strong>options</strong>).&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<strong><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\">Supporting idea 1:&nbsp;</span></strong>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZSGudTTeHoUUbwxmgwvlnevNg0d\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Br0HdPtt2o6yaDxssU5lFwBbgic\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CXHedb5Q5o0ChTxzjeJlACIHgBe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Qw7XdcQDiopHAmxbaJzlaWDZgjb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EAA1dQKV5otLAmxFGgBlpln2gIe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N5dHdBAjeojWA3xMEbCl8pn1gyB\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-IAbldxsOzoo2wFxmKA9lpeamg5g\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-W5LKdbd9loeueaxjhjblwWW1gGb\">Việc giảng dạy c&aacute;c m&ocirc;n khoa học ở trường qu&aacute; ch&uacute; trọng v&agrave;o l&yacute; thuyết (<strong>overemphasis on theory</strong>)</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-W5LKdbd9loeueaxjhjblwWW1gGb\">&nbsp; ➜ thiếu c&aacute;c th&iacute; nghiệm thực h&agrave;nh (<strong>hands-on laboratory experiments</strong>)</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-W5LKdbd9loeueaxjhjblwWW1gGb\">&nbsp; ➜ học sinh cần hiểu v&agrave; thấy được ứng dụng thực tế (<strong>practical applications</strong>) của khoa học để k&iacute;ch th&iacute;ch hứng th&uacute; (<strong>spark their</strong> <strong>interest</strong>)</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-W5LKdbd9loeueaxjhjblwWW1gGb\">&nbsp; ➜ kh&ocirc;ng được tham gia th&iacute; nghiệm th&igrave; khoa học trở n&ecirc;n nh&agrave;m ch&aacute;n (<strong>dull and tedious</strong>)</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<strong><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\">&nbsp;Supporting idea 2:</span></strong>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RJW5dfJhqofjuXxEd7dlCvwzg3b\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LQSEdv0Y1oIVaoxMMoxljdOvgOd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HNQNdCbCpoystuxVP43luHtDgeb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HJ7FdScShoqf2QxHEgylSbaAgyf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NFfDdmOXNoOWwZxiNtZl15SMgkh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-A0zKdQFrWoIXtex6mhplQSoegxb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-T2mWd1rtBo8T07x6awTlNUNqg9f\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-IURud5igKoxTX8xzLYFlj0BEgTf\">Cơ hội nghề nghiệp v&agrave; việc l&agrave;m trong lĩnh vực khoa học bị hạn chế (<strong>limited career options</strong>)</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-IURud5igKoxTX8xzLYFlj0BEgTf\">&nbsp; ➜ nhu cầu (<strong>demand</strong>) v&agrave; mức lương (<strong>pay rates</strong>) cho c&aacute;c ng&agrave;nh kh&aacute;c như marketing, IT, tư vấn ph&aacute;p l&yacute; (<strong>legal counsel</strong>) cao hơn nhiều</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-IURud5igKoxTX8xzLYFlj0BEgTf\">&nbsp; ➜ việc l&agrave;m trong ng&agrave;nh khoa học chủ yếu chỉ c&oacute; ở c&aacute;c trường đại học, v&agrave; thường thiếu kinh ph&iacute; (<strong>struggle to arrange suitable funding</strong>)</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-IURud5igKoxTX8xzLYFlj0BEgTf\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-I85fdLrlqovzpLxkUCfldUM5gEg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4. Gợi &yacute; viết BODY 2</strong> </span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-I85fdLrlqovzpLxkUCfldUM5gEg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FkKtdjQLbo1AtlxkzyalC6VXgEc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AZT8dluWuoiebixsy4zlDBdDg8f\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ub8odKVWsohu3TxKHTylRfJ3gqT\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IO0OdZMbkop2KtxaAgbl07P0g3f\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ap4ndJ97bocXozxn7oAl3Txmgte\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FwiNdcUNSoCW0UxEnPxlYn1NgYe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Lsjlde9EKo9cSdxAvmulNTZPgbd\">Trong BODY 2, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ ph&acirc;n t&iacute;ch c&aacute;c hậu quả đối với x&atilde; hội ở cấp độ quốc gia v&agrave; to&agrave;n cầu.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Lsjlde9EKo9cSdxAvmulNTZPgbd\">Cấu tr&uacute;c đơn giản l&agrave;: Topic Sentence ➜ Supporting Idea 1 ➜ Supporting idea 2</div>\n</div>\n<strong><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\">Topic sentence:</span></strong></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-ZakddQ7nJoAgFyxpFvNleucyg4d\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OBDmdoEGDoDyBgxNOqylocGigdc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PoBydy7ixoRrKIxO5gdlnQbzg7e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-FPwwd6a20oL0khxlV17lQP1fgSh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-CLHQd8Vyjoq587xOQKBlr5EDg4b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-S7aRdGLyNosSu1xSQdFln5kugHs\">Xu hướng đ&aacute;ng lo ngại n&agrave;y ảnh hưởng đến x&atilde; hội ở cả cấp độ quốc gia v&agrave; to&agrave;n cầu (<strong>national and global levels</strong>).</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<strong><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\">Supporting idea 1:</span></strong>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OOMmd2z40oU1GpxeAiOljjORg6c\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-IP8udCf4UodaQ1xp6r1lvwiTgHc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-FWGcdCLrAodR0zx9hxultvvcg0c\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-JcusdZSFzovztExclQWl7chLg4e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Q9rFdK1ipoSiH8x8Lc1lqPoUgYf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AZa1dU6WtoYm51x9m3JlC8V6gQe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-G35adIotboSlwYxl0TulS1RkgJh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-FJpsdw8FcoInuxxcv8xlxsMpgob\">Thiếu hụt lực lượng lao động trong c&aacute;c ng&agrave;nh khoa học (<strong>a shortage in the scientific workforce</strong>) cản trở khả năng đổi mới (<strong>innovate</strong>) li&ecirc;n tục</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-FJpsdw8FcoInuxxcv8xlxsMpgob\">&nbsp; ➜ khả năng đổi mới quan trọng cho việc ph&aacute;t triển c&ocirc;ng nghệ v&agrave; ng&agrave;nh c&ocirc;ng nghiệp mới (<strong>new technologies and industries</strong>)</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-FJpsdw8FcoInuxxcv8xlxsMpgob\">&nbsp; ➜ việc dạy c&aacute;c m&ocirc;n khoa học rất quan trọng để duy tr&igrave; khả năng cạnh tranh (<strong>competitiveness</strong>) tr&ecirc;n thị trường quốc tế (<strong>international markets</strong>)</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-FJpsdw8FcoInuxxcv8xlxsMpgob\">&nbsp; ➜ c&aacute;c quốc gia th&agrave;nh c&ocirc;ng nhất l&agrave; những nước ưu ti&ecirc;n c&aacute;c m&ocirc;n khoa học trong gi&aacute;o dục</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<strong><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\">&nbsp;Supporting idea 2:</span></strong>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VZnEdzqc4oEV4wxO5mZluCDFgQd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BXimdSddLo8wilxpbXMli5xmgBf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CXfQd5foZotNYvxR3yulUfOegnb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JKs3d2HFfoJfLcxOlhZlsYPPgOc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OVGzda09ioegiAxjp4BlwN6Ugee\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Dc96dxi8Do6jiRxbpzIlbykXgw1\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-SmqNdAdGQozDyNxx9Ufl3QlCgZg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Thế giới đang đối mặt với nhiều th&aacute;ch thức chưa từng c&oacute; trước đ&acirc;y (<strong>unprecedented challenges</strong>)</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-SmqNdAdGQozDyNxx9Ufl3QlCgZg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp; ➜ rất cần những giải ph&aacute;p dựa tr&ecirc;n khoa học (<strong>science-based solutions</strong>) để đối ph&oacute;</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-SmqNdAdGQozDyNxx9Ufl3QlCgZg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp; ➜ thiếu sinh vi&ecirc;n chọn ng&agrave;nh khoa học sẽ khiến c&aacute;c giải ph&aacute;p n&agrave;y trở n&ecirc;n bất khả thi (<strong>an impossible task</strong>)</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 97,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction ",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EuLPdvtp3orKY8xteNNlIE0FgTe\">It has been observed that there is a global decline in the number of science students. <strong>There are many factors leading to this alarming tendency that has affected society on different levels.</strong></div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 12893,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 98,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GUZXdaqfhoYGYkxYIdqlEiFGgVe\"><strong>This trend stems from several factors, two of which are the loss of interest in the subject and limited career options. </strong><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\">The fact that science-related subjects are taught in high school with an overemphasis on theory, and lacking more hands-on laboratory experiments, is one of the main factors contributing to the decline in participation in science majors. This is because students studying a deep, complex subject like science need to witness firsthand its practical applications in order to spark their interest. Therefore, in the absence of adequate experimentation, science may appear to be incredibly dull and tedious. </span><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\">Moreover, limited career options and job openings could be another main factor influencing students' academic pursuits. The demand, and associated pay rates, for other fields, such as marketing, IT, and legal counsel, can be markedly higher, while science jobs are most often found in university settings and struggle to arrange suitable funding.</span></div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 12893,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 99,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 2 ",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-APb8dCjxvo4jIexVJNdlQxhlgHt\"><strong>This worrying trend has affected society on both national and global levels. </strong><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\">Regarding the effects on a given nation's economic growth, a shortage in the scientific workforce hinders their ability to continually innovate, which is vital for the development of new technologies and industries. This highlights the importance of science education in maintaining a nation&rsquo;s competitiveness in international markets. On a global scale, the most successful countries are those that promote science in education. <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\">Furthermore, the world today is facing unprecedented challenges, and science-based solutions are urgently needed to face them. Without enough students choosing science as their major, this could prove to be an impossible task.</span></span></div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 12893,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 100,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Conclusion ",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ReRPddoNZoxV6vxrlOClFcaIgSg\">In conclusion, the decrease in the number of science majors worldwide could have been caused by the lack of interest in the subject and job opportunities. Society and the planet will face serious challenges if there are not enough scientists in the future. It is vital for the government to have specific policies that could potentially remedy the issues.</div>\n</div>",
